---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="She Rocks Finances | You Happen to Your Life" description="Alisa's journey from burnout in 2021 to a 15-month sabbatical and a stronger return in 2023, and the choices every woman has to work with purpose and intention.">
<div class="topbar">The She Rocks Ledger launches December 2026 · Essays by Alisa, free every other week <a href="#ledger">Subscribe free</a></div>

<header class="wrap hdr">
  <a href="#" aria-label="She Rocks Finances home"><img src="/logo.png" alt="She Rocks Finances"></a>
  <nav aria-label="Main"><a href="#journey">The Journey</a><a href="#exit-plan">The Exit Plan</a><a href="#ledger">The Ledger</a><a href="#alisa">About Alisa</a><a href="#toolkit">Toolkit</a><a href="#shop">Shop</a><a class="btn" href="#ledger" style="min-height:44px;padding:0 20px">Subscribe</a></nav>
</header>

<section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="copy">
      <div class="rule"></div>
      <div class="eyebrow">Alisa's journey · The Exit Plan</div>
      <h1 id="hero-title">You <span class="kw">happen to your life.</span><span class="second">Your life doesn't happen to you.</span></h1>
      <p>In 2021 I left corporate America burned out. In 2023 I went back stronger, on my own terms. Now every choice I make is about deciding how and when I leave. You have the same choices.</p>
      <div class="row">
        <a class="btn" href="#exit-plan"><svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 5v14l11-7z"/></svg>Watch Chapter One</a>
        <a class="btn line" href="#journey">See the journey</a>
      </div>

    </div>

    <div class="feature">
      <div class="frame hero-video" style="display:block">
        <div class="still">
          <video id="hero-video" src="/media/hero-clip-25s.mp4" poster="/media/hero-clip-poster.jpg" loop playsinline preload="metadata" aria-label="Alisa in The Exit Plan, Episode 2: a 25-second preview"></video>
          <button class="play hv-btn" type="button" aria-label="Play the 25-second preview"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 5v14l11-7z"/></svg></button>
        </div>
        <div class="nowplaying"><div><small>Preview · Chapter One</small><strong>Episode 2: Something Has to Change</strong></div><span>0:25</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="journey-card">
        <div class="eyebrow">Her journey</div>
        <ol>
          <li><b>2021</b><span>Left corporate, burned out</span></li>
          <li><b>2021–22</b><span>15-month sabbatical</span></li>
          <li><b>2023</b><span>Returned, stronger</span></li>
          <li><b>Next 10 yrs</b><span>Her timing, her terms</span></li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="wrap" id="exit-plan">
  <div class="head">
    <div><div class="eyebrow">The Exit Plan · Chapter One: 2021</div><h2>An exit plan is about <span class="kw">choosing when</span></h2></div>
    <a class="u" href="#">See all episodes</a>
  </div>
  <div class="rail">
    <a class="ep" href="#"><div class="frame"><div class="still"><span class="num">EP 01</span><span class="play"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 5v14l11-7z"/></svg></span><span class="time">[MM:SS]</span></div></div><span class="tag">Chapter One · 2021</span><h3>The Promotion</h3><p>The workload grows, and burnout sets in.</p></a>
    <a class="ep" href="#"><div class="frame"><div class="still" style="background:linear-gradient(155deg,#262626,#0A0A0A)"><span class="num">EP 02</span><span class="play"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 5v14l11-7z"/></svg></span><span class="time">[MM:SS]</span></div></div><span class="tag">Chapter One · 2021</span><h3>Something Has to Change</h3><p>A conversation at home that made it clear.</p></a>
    <a class="ep" href="#"><div class="frame"><div class="still" style="background:linear-gradient(155deg,#333333,#141414)"><span class="num">EP 03</span><span class="play"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 5v14l11-7z"/></svg></span><span class="time">[MM:SS]</span></div></div><span class="tag">Chapter One · 2021</span><h3>The Decision</h3><p>"You act as if it's all on you," and choosing to step away.</p></a>
    <div class="ep upcoming"><div class="frame"><div class="still"><span class="num">Coming next</span></div></div><span class="tag">Chapter Two · 2021–22</span><h3>The Sabbatical</h3><p>Fifteen months to rest, reset and rediscover herself.</p></div>
    <div class="ep upcoming"><div class="frame"><div class="still"><span class="num">Coming next</span></div></div><span class="tag">Chapter Three · 2023</span><h3>The Return</h3><p>Back to corporate America, on her own terms.</p></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="journey" id="journey">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="head">
      <div><div class="eyebrow">The journey</div><h2>Four chapters, <span class="kw">one choice at a time</span></h2></div>
      <p>Burnout wasn't the end of the story. It was the moment I decided to take charge of what came next.</p>
    </div>
    <ol class="chapters">
      <li><span class="big" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="card"><span class="yr">2021</span><h3>Burnout and the leap</h3><p>The promotions kept coming and so did the workload, until I chose to step away.</p></div></li>
      <li><span class="big" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="card"><span class="yr">2021–22</span><h3>The sabbatical</h3><p>Fifteen months to rest, reset and remember who I am outside a job title.</p></div></li>
      <li><span class="big" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="card"><span class="yr">2023</span><h3>The return</h3><p>Back in corporate America, reinvigorated, with a stronger sense of self.</p></div></li>
      <li class="now"><span class="big" aria-hidden="true">4</span><div class="card"><span class="yr">The next 10 years</span><h3>Working with intention</h3><p>Every choice now is about one thing: I decide how I leave, and when.</p></div></li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="choices" id="choices">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="head">
      <div><div class="eyebrow">Your choices</div><h2>Every woman gets to <span class="kw">choose</span></h2></div>
      <p>Working with purpose means your money gives you options. These are the three you always have.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="cgrid">
      <div class="choice"><span class="verb" aria-hidden="true">Stay</span><h3>Stay with intention</h3><p>Grow your career on purpose, and let your income fund your future options.</p></div>
      <div class="choice"><span class="verb" aria-hidden="true">Pause</span><h3>Pause with a plan</h3><p>Take the break you need, funded by savings you built for exactly that.</p></div>
      <div class="choice"><span class="verb" aria-hidden="true">Leave</span><h3>Leave on your terms</h3><p>Choose your timing and your next move, not someone else's.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="meet" id="alisa">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="circle"><span class="cap">Video still · Alisa</span></div>
    <div class="t">
      <div class="eyebrow">Meet Alisa</div>
      <h2>I stopped letting my career <em>happen to me.</em></h2>
      <p>Years ago I learned the hard way that money comes and goes very easily, and that a high credit score doesn't mean financial health. I paid off my student loans, gave up credit cards and lived through a 12-month spending freeze.</p>
      <p>In 2021 burnout pushed me out of corporate America. After a 15-month sabbatical I went back in 2023 with a stronger sense of self. Now I work with purpose, making the choices that let me decide how and when I leave.</p>
      <p class="sig">Alisa</p>
      <a class="u" href="#">Read Alisa's story</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="wrap" id="ledger">
  <div class="club">
    <div class="b">
      <div class="eyebrow">From Alisa's desk · On Substack</div>
      <h2>The She Rocks Ledger</h2>
      <p>Long-form essays on working with purpose, making intentional money choices and building a life you choose.</p>
      <ul>
        <li><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12l5 5 9-10"/></svg>Bi-weekly essays by Alisa</li>
        <li><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12l5 5 9-10"/></svg>Weekly Wealth Briefs</li>
        <li><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12l5 5 9-10"/></svg>Monthly money mindset check-ins</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="issue">
      <div class="meta"><span>Issue No. 1</span><span>December 2026</span></div>
      <h3>The founding manifesto: happening to my life, and why I went back on my own terms</h3>
      <p>The first essay arrives the week the site launches. Subscribe now and it lands in your inbox.</p>
      <form class="signup js-form" novalidate>
        <label class="sr" for="ledger-email">Email address</label>
        <input id="ledger-email" type="email" required placeholder="Your email address" autocomplete="email">
        <button class="btn gold" type="submit">Subscribe free</button>
      </form>
      <p class="msg" role="status"></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="pr">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div style="display:grid;justify-items:center"><div class="rule"></div></div>
    <h2>I believe there are 10 principles to <span class="kw">financial success</span></h2>
    <ol class="plist">
      <li><b>1</b>Be creative and curious</li>
      <li><b>2</b>Value your income</li>
      <li><b>3</b>Limit the use of debt</li>
      <li><b>4</b>Save money like a Rockefeller</li>
      <li><b>5</b>Small beginnings do not mean small endings</li>
      <li><b>6</b>Commit to financial literacy</li>
      <li><b>7</b>GoFundMe is not a plan, get insurance</li>
      <li><b>8</b>Make health and self-care a priority</li>
      <li><b>9</b>Don't give your kids stuff, give them a budget</li>
      <li><b>10</b>Measure progress, not perfection</li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="wrap" id="toolkit">
  <div class="head">
    <div><div class="eyebrow">The Toolkit · Free</div><h2>Tools for <span class="kw">intentional choices</span></h2></div>
    <a class="u" href="#">See all tools</a>
  </div>
  <div class="tools">
    <a class="tool" href="#"><div class="pv">Worksheet preview</div><span class="t">Budgeting</span><h3>Budget Like a Pro Worksheet</h3><small>Excel · PDF · Google Sheets</small></a>
    <a class="tool" href="#"><div class="pv">Challenge preview</div><span class="t">Reset</span><h3>14 Days to Reboot Your Finances</h3><small>Daily challenge</small></a>
    <a class="tool" href="#"><div class="pv">Guide preview</div><span class="t">Debt</span><h3>Get Out of Debt: 5 Things to Do Differently</h3><small>Guide</small></a>
    <a class="tool" href="#"><div class="pv">Guide preview</div><span class="t">Saving</span><h3>Save More Money, Even on a Tight Budget</h3><small>Guide</small></a>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="wrap soon" id="shop" style="padding-top:0">
  <div>
    <div class="eyebrow">Coming soon</div>
    <h2 style="font-size:clamp(32px,3.8vw,46px);margin:8px 0 18px">Built for your <span class="kw">next chapter</span></h2>
    <div class="offers">
      <div class="offer"><span class="tag">Masterclass</span><h3>Pitch Your Worth</h3><p>Know your value and negotiate for it, whether you stay, grow or go.</p></div>
      <div class="offer"><span class="tag">Planner</span><h3>Budgeting with Elegance</h3><p>Intentional spending and saving, so your money keeps your options open.</p></div>
      <div class="offer"><span class="tag">Coaching</span><h3>Work with Alisa</h3><p>Map your next ten years, with real numbers and choices that are yours.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <form class="wl js-form" novalidate>
    <h3>Join the waitlist</h3>
    <p style="color:var(--muted)">You'll hear first, before anything opens to the public.</p>
    <fieldset>
      <legend>I'm interested in</legend>
      <label class="chk"><input id="wl-masterclass" type="checkbox" checked> Masterclass</label>
      <label class="chk"><input id="wl-planner" type="checkbox"> Planner</label>
      <label class="chk"><input id="wl-coaching" type="checkbox"> Coaching</label>
    </fieldset>
    <div class="signup">
      <label class="sr" for="wl-email">Email address</label>
      <input id="wl-email" type="email" required placeholder="Your email address" autocomplete="email">
      <button class="btn" type="submit">Join</button>
    </div>
    <p class="msg" role="status"></p>
  </form>
</section>

<section class="band" id="share">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="eyebrow" style="color:var(--ink)">Guest stories</div>
    <h2>When did you start happening to your life?</h2>
    <p>You chose to stay and grow, to pause, or to leave on your own timeline. Alisa is looking for women to interview for future episodes of The Exit Plan.</p>
    <a class="btn" href="#">Share your story</a>
  </div>
</section>

<footer>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="frow">
      <div><img src="/logo.png" alt="She Rocks Finances"><p>You happen to your life. Your life doesn't happen to you.</p></div>
      <div class="cols">
        <div><h4>Explore</h4><a href="#journey">The Journey</a><a href="#exit-plan">The Exit Plan</a><a href="#ledger">The Ledger</a><a href="#toolkit">Toolkit</a><a href="#shop">Shop</a></div>
        <div><h4>About</h4><a href="#alisa">About Alisa</a><a href="#share">Share your story</a><a href="#">Links</a><a href="#">Contact</a></div>
        <div><h4>Follow</h4><a href="#">YouTube</a><a href="#">Instagram · @sherocksfinances</a><a href="#">Alisa · [ALISA HANDLE]</a><a href="#">Substack</a></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="legal"><span>© 2026 She Rocks Finances Inc. Educational content, not individual financial advice.</span><span><a href="#">Privacy</a><a href="#">Terms</a><a href="#">Disclosures</a></span></div>
  </div>
</footer>
<script is:inline>
(function(){
  var v=document.getElementById('hero-video'); if(!v)return;
  var box=v.closest('.hero-video'), btn=box.querySelector('.hv-btn');
  btn.addEventListener('click',function(){ var p=v.play(); if(p&&p.catch)p.catch(function(){}); });
  v.addEventListener('click',function(){ if(!v.paused) v.pause(); });
  v.addEventListener('play',function(){ box.classList.add('is-playing'); btn.setAttribute('aria-label','Playing'); });
  v.addEventListener('pause',function(){ box.classList.remove('is-playing'); btn.setAttribute('aria-label','Play the 25-second preview'); });
})();
document.querySelectorAll('.js-form').forEach(function(f){
  f.addEventListener('submit',function(e){
    e.preventDefault();
    var input=f.querySelector('input[type=email]');
    var msg=f.querySelector('.msg');
    if(!msg)return;
    if(!input.value||!input.checkValidity()){msg.textContent='Enter a valid email address to continue.';input.focus();return;}
    msg.textContent='Preview only. On the live site this sign-up goes to '+(f.classList.contains('wl')?'the waitlist.':'The She Rocks Ledger on Substack.');
  });
});
</script>

</Base>
